  "_comment": "New-game clock, money, save defaults and partner birth values. Jijimon asks all seven questions; starters is the complete partner-rookie pool (p254 stores its index). quiz.weights are sparse points by axis; quiz.cells has 45 starter indices in element/attribute/temperament order: battle, fire, ice, nature, air (mech counts as air); vaccine, data, virus; bold, calm, cunning. Highest score wins each axis; ties favour the most recent answer, then the earlier axis in that order if the same answer last supported both. Weights are packed as up to three axis/weight nibbles per answer; species ids are uint16, cells uint8. Two spare cells repeat species. The cell assignment favours attributes, then specialties: unavoidable exceptions are documented in docs/mods/balance.md. startScript selects the opening MAPHEAD section; cardShopStart is the first six card-shop script-state values. Missing ordinary rules mean zero. The conversation is in script_menu.c; dialogue uses the named text-bank mechanism.",
